# {{ site.title }}

> {{ site.description | safe }}

Andean Road is a personal travel guide to Chile written by one author — Karol, born in Chile, raised in New York. It is written in English, and every place listed here has been visited by the author personally; nothing is aggregated or scraped. Guides are multi-day itineraries, places are individual spots worth the trip, and practical pages cover the unglamorous essentials.

